                <span class="text-gold-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-gold-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-gold-500/20">Questions Answered</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-white mt-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span>How long does elevator manufacturing and installation take?</span>
                        <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-400"></i>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 hidden leading-relaxed">
                        Standard residential and villa home lifts take approximately 3 to 4 weeks for custom manufacturing and 7-10 days for installation on site. Commercial high-rise lifts vary depending on shaft height.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span>Can an elevator be installed in an existing home without a pit?</span>
                        <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-400"></i>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 hidden leading-relaxed">
                        Yes! Our Leo Imperial Home Series features pitless hydraulic and belt-traction technology requiring only 150mm pit depth or a small ramp step. No major civil structural demolition required.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span>What warranty and Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC) do you provide?</span>
                        <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-400"></i>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 hidden leading-relaxed">
                        All new installations come with a 2-year comprehensive warranty and 1 year of complimentary AMC including quarterly routine safety inspections and 24/7 breakdown callouts.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

